; AlgoX SuperTrend Pro EA - preset 05_NY_Breakout_Momentum
; New York session breakout momentum
; family: session | hard filters: InpMACDMode, InpVolAvgMode, InpUseSessionFilter, InpMaxSpreadPoints>0
; The same breakout idea, tuned for the New York session (the most volatile window) and with softer quality gates: participation above its average and MACD as hard filters, 200-bar extremes, SuperTrend and relative volume as score, plus a spread cap. Stop entry beyond the signal candle keeps the entry adaptive.
; Generated by generate_presets.py - do not edit by hand.
; Copy to MQL4/Presets and load it from the Inputs tab (Load button).
; Coherence rules: max 2 hard filters per family, max 5 in total,
; everything else inside a family stays on score so the filters do not fight each other.

